---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for waterdamagerestorationbelmontnc.us. How we handle information submitted through our website."
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span> / </span>
        <span>Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: November 2025</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>
        This privacy policy describes how {site.name} (“we,” “us”) handles information collected through the website {site.domain}.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you use our contact form, we collect the details you choose to provide—typically your name, phone number, email address, and message content. We use this information solely to respond to your inquiry and provide the services you request.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our website may automatically receive standard technical data such as browser type, device type, and approximate location derived from IP address. This information is used for basic analytics and security, not to identify you personally.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to contact form submissions and phone inquiries</li>
        <li>To schedule and perform water damage assessment or restoration services</li>
        <li>To improve the website and understand general usage patterns</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations when required</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Form processing</h2>
      <p>
        Contact form submissions are processed through Web3Forms, a third-party form handling service. Their handling of data is governed by their own privacy policy. We do not sell or rent your contact information to third parties for marketing.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <p>
        This site aims to keep tracking minimal. Any cookies used are limited to essential functionality or basic, privacy-respecting analytics. You can control cookies through your browser settings.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain contact form information only as long as needed to respond to your request and for reasonable business records related to services performed. You may request deletion of your personal information by contacting us.
      </p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable steps to protect information submitted through the site. No method of transmission over the internet is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.
      </p>

      <h2>Children’s privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our services are directed to adults and property owners. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy may be directed to us by phone at <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a> or through our <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. The “last updated” date at the top of this page will reflect the most recent revision.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
